    "notes": "<div class=\"o-metadata__file-usage-entry\">HUMAN_FOVEAL_CONES<div class=\"o-metadata__file-description\">This dataset contains high resolution images of the foveal region of 28 eyes of 16 subjects. The images are accompanied by text files listing all cone locations in pixels. There is a Matlab script that can be used to plot the cone locations on the corresponding image. There is a *.csv file listing the subject code, eye, retinal magnification factor (microns/degree) and image scale (pixels per degree).</div><div class=\"o-metadata__file-name\"></div></div>"
